# JobLens UI theme

Simple, light interface. Use these tokens for every screen, component, and chart. Do not introduce other brand colors.

## Color

| Use | Color | Hex |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Page background | Very light grey | `#F8FAFC` |
| Cards / surfaces | White | `#FFFFFF` |
| Borders | Soft grey | `#E2E8F0` |
| Main text | Dark slate | `#1E293B` |
| Secondary text | Muted grey | `#64748B` |
| Primary (buttons, links) | Soft blue | `#3B82F6` |
| Primary light (highlights, navbar active) | Pale blue | `#DBEAFE` |
| Safe / Low risk | Green on pale green | `#16A34A` on `#DCFCE7` |
| Caution / Medium risk | Amber on pale amber | `#D97706` on `#FEF3C7` |
| Scam / High risk | Red on pale red | `#DC2626` on `#FEE2E2` |

Chart colors (pastel), in order: `#93C5FD`, `#86EFAC`, `#FCD34D`, `#FCA5A5`, `#C4B5FD`.

Risk badges always pair the text color with its pale background. Primary actions and links use `#3B82F6`. Active nav and highlights use `#DBEAFE`.

## Type

Load Inter from Google Fonts and use it for all UI text.

## Style

- Rounded corners on cards, buttons, inputs, and badges.
- Soft shadows on cards and raised surfaces. Keep them light so the page stays airy.
- Generous white space between sections, cards, and form fields.
- Page background is `#F8FAFC`. Content sits on white cards with `#E2E8F0` borders.
